From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:49:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: custom border colours for Zink

KosmicKrisp exposes VK_EXT_custom_border_color and
VK_EXT_border_color_swizzle only with MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=custom_border.
Zink needs them for OpenGL's GL_CLAMP_TO_BORDER colours; without them a
border sample reads transparent black. The flag is read once per process
and applies to every instance, so it cannot be set for OpenGL alone.

An instance whose engine is Zink ("mesa zink") now gets both
extensions. Other instances (DXVK, vkd3d-proton) are unchanged unless
the flag is set. On an A19 Pro the OpenGL probe reads the
GL_CLAMP_TO_BORDER colour back right with them, and Portal 2 (DXVK)
with the flag set showed no steady change in GPU time a frame.

Class: feature
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-12-zink-followups.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c | 13 +++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
index 46ef602..b7be613 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
@@ -30,6 +30,8 @@
 #include "vk_drm_syncobj.h"
 #include "vk_shader_module.h"
 
+#include <string.h>
+
 #if DETECT_OS_APPLE
 #include <TargetConditionals.h>
 #endif
@@ -62,6 +64,13 @@ kk_get_device_extensions(const struct kk_instance *instance,
                          const struct kk_physical_device *pdev,
                          struct vk_device_extension_table *ext)
 {
+   /* Custom border colours are experimental, except for Zink: OpenGL's
+    * GL_CLAMP_TO_BORDER needs them, and they read back right there.
+    */
+   const char *engine = instance->vk.app_info.engine_name;
+   const bool custom_border = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(CUSTOM_BORDER) ||
+                              (engine && !strcmp(engine, "mesa zink"));
+
    *ext = (struct vk_device_extension_table){
       /* Vulkan 1.1 */
       .KHR_16bit_storage = true,
@@ -189,10 +198,10 @@ kk_get_device_extensions(const struct kk_instance *instance,
       .EXT_attachment_feedback_loop_layout = true,
       .EXT_attachment_feedback_loop_dynamic_state = true,
       .EXT_blend_operation_advanced = true,
-      .EXT_border_color_swizzle = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(CUSTOM_BORDER),
+      .EXT_border_color_swizzle = custom_border,
       .EXT_calibrated_timestamps = true,
       .EXT_conditional_rendering = true,
-      .EXT_custom_border_color = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(CUSTOM_BORDER),
+      .EXT_custom_border_color = custom_border,
       .EXT_custom_resolve = true,
       .EXT_debug_marker = true,
       .EXT_depth_clip_control = true,
-- 
